    prompt: 'A daughter asks why her mother with early Alzheimer disease remembers her wedding 50 years ago clearly but cannot remember a visit this morning. Explain this using the stages and types of memory, the role of the hippocampus, and the difference between anterograde and retrograde memory loss. Then suggest two memory supports for the family.',
